<title>GERMANY: AMB details finalised 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>AMB details finalised 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>AACHEN, Germany 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   343.4   vs 262.3</p>
<p>    Group sales				  20,000  up 6.9 pct</p>
<p>    --Of which insurance premiums	  17,100  up 5.4 pct</p>
<p>    --Of which mortgage business	   2,100   up 16.1 pct</p>
<p>Underwriting profit before allocations to reserves</p>
<p>						     389.6   vs 294.7</p>
<p>    DVFA earnings per share		  71 dmk  vs 49.1 dmk</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer and financial services group is Aachener und Muenchener Beteiligungs AG (AMB). The company had already reported full preliminary earnings in February.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
